'''Hoth''' was a remote, icy [[planet]] that was the sixth planet in the [[star system]] of the [[Hoth system|same name]], located in the [[Anoat sector]] of [[the galaxy]]'s [[Outer Rim Territories]]. It was the [[homeworld]] to the primitive [[wampa]] [[species]].

It notably hosted [[Echo Base]] during the [[Galactic Civil War]], the temporary headquarters of the [[Alliance to Restore the Republic]], until the [[Galactic Empire]] located them, initiating a major confrontation known as the [[Battle of Hoth]]. In the months following, [[scavenger]]s established temporary base camps on the planet to scrap the [[All Terrain Armored Transport|AT-ATs]] destroyed.

In the [[Standard month|months]] after the [[Battle of Endor]], rumors emerged about the [[New Republic]] intending to repurpose Hoth into a [[prison]] for those who remained loyal to the Empire, however, the credibility of the rumors were dismissed as [[Chancellor (New Republic)|Chancellor]] [[Mon Mothma]] had been dedicated to a pretext of justice over punishment. Meanwhile, the war returned to Hoth, where it became the site of another [[Battle of Hoth (Iron Blockade)|battle]] during the [[Iron Blockade]].

